# apps/web local environment — only needed when running this workspace DIRECTLY
# (cd apps/web && bun run dev). The orchestrated root commands
# (`bun run dev` / `bun run start` at the repository root) use the ROOT .env
# instead — copy `.env.example` from the repository root.
#
# Bun automatically loads this file into the environment of scripts started
# inside apps/web.

# Web dev-server port. strictPort is on: a taken port fails loudly instead of
# silently hopping to the next one. The production-like preview defaults to
# 4173 when this is unset.
# AISE_WEB_PORT=5173
